   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n  \r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n    <p>Irene</p>\r\n    <p>Adding to Davids comments.  Have a look at Buckland et al. (2010)\r\n      that has some comparison of line transect distance sampling with\r\n      the Kelker strip method:</p>\r\n    <div style=\"line-height:2;margin-left:2em\">\r\n      <div>Buckland, S. T., A. J. Plumptre, L. Thomas,\r\n        and E. A. Rexstad. 2010. Line transect sampling of primates: can\r\n        animal-to-observer distance methods work? International Journal\r\n        of Primatology 31:485–499. <span style=\"font-size:13.2837px;font-family:serif\">DOI 10.1007/s10764-010-9408-4</span></div>\r\n      <div><br>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div><br>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <span title=\"url_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fzotero.org%3A2&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1007%2Fs10764-010-9408-4&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Line%20Transect%20Sampling%20of%20Primates%3A%20can%20Animal-to-Observer%20Distance%20Methods%20Work%3F&amp;rft.jtitle=International%20Journal%20of%20Primatology&amp;rft.volume=31&amp;rft.issue=3&amp;rft.aufirst=Stephen%20T.&amp;rft.aulast=Buckland&amp;rft.au=Stephen%20T.%20Buckland&amp;rft.au=Andrew%20J.%20Plumptre&amp;rft.au=Len%20Thomas&amp;rft.au=Eric%20A.%20Rexstad&amp;rft.date=2010&amp;rft.pages=485-499&amp;rft.spage=485&amp;rft.epage=499&amp;rft.issn=0164-0291\"></span></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n    <div>On 06/09/2019 04:30, Irene Duch Latorre\r\n      wrote:<br>\r\n    </div>\r\n    </div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\"><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      \r\n      <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\">Dear\r\n          colleagues,</div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\"><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\">I\r\n          hope this email finds you well. We have decided to compare\r\n          density estimates calculated using Conventional Distance\r\n          Sampling with those obtained with the Kelker method for our\r\n          project. I acknowledge this email list is intended to share\r\n          thoughts about the distance sampling technique, but I though\r\n          some of you may also have expertise in the (related) Kelker\r\n          method.  <br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\"><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\">My\r\n          question is: How do you choose the interval cutpoints for the\r\n          distance histogram? From my understanding, it is subjective,\r\n          but I would appreciate any insight or experience you can\r\n          share.</div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\"><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\">Thank\r\n          you for your help and for your time. I am looking forward to\r\n          your reply.</div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\"><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\">Best\r\n          regards,</div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\"><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\">Irene<br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\"><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>\r\n          <div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\">\r\n            <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n              <div>\r\n                <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n                  <div>\r\n                    <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n                      <div>\r\n                        <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n                          <div>\r\n                            <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n                              <div>\r\n                                <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n                                  <div>\r\n                                    <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n                                      <div>\r\n                                        <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n                                          <div>\r\n                                            <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n                                              <div>\r\n                                                <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n                                                  <div>\r\n                                                    <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n                                                      <div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(0,255,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Irene Duch-Latorre</span><br>\r\n                                                          </span></span></span></font></div>\r\n                                                      <font